; Exploration HUD, FFT/MYZ/OAG layout (2026-09-28): room banner top centre, Wardstone and objective
; top right, party face cards along the bottom, the floor plan in a round frame bottom right, and
; the parchment party menu floating beside the party (DungeonHud.AnchorPartyMenu). Development
; controls sit top left and only show in the standalone test scene.

